ID<code>argon:clone</code> Summons clones of the user that copy their look and gear and fight beside them. At max_active, activating dismisses the oldest clone instead. SettingsExample 1Example 2Example 3In a power <p>KeyTypeDescriptionRequiredFallback<code>summon_count</code>(Dynamic) ValueHow many clones to summon per activation.✗1<code>max_active</code>(Dynamic) ValueHow many clones can exist at once.✗1<code>max_total</code>(Dynamic) ValueLifetime cap on clones summoned, ignoring dismissed ones. Unlimited if unset.✗/<code>clone_modifiers</code>Clone Modifier[]Applied in order to every clone. Clones start with the user's max health, attack damage and movement speed. Each stat is a value (multiplier) or {"amount": value, "operation": "multiply" / "add" / "set"}. "powers" lists power ids to give the clone.✗[]<code>show_name</code>BooleanWhether clones get the user's name as a floating name tag. When false they have no name at all.✗true</p> <p><p><code>clone_modifiers[]</code> (Clone Modifier)</p></p> <p>KeyTypeDescriptionRequiredFallback<code>health</code>(Dynamic) Value,Stat ModifierChanges the clone's maximum health.✗/<code>attack_damage</code>(Dynamic) Value,Stat ModifierChanges the clone's attack damage.✗/<code>movement_speed</code>(Dynamic) Value,Stat ModifierChanges the clone's movement speed.✗/<code>powers</code>Power ID(s) / TagThe powers the clone gets.✗/</p> <p><p><code>clone_modifiers[].health</code> (Stat Modifier)</p></p> <p>KeyTypeDescriptionRequiredFallback<code>amount</code>(Dynamic) ValueThe amount to apply.✓/<code>operation</code><code>multiply</code><code>add</code><code>set</code>How the amount is applied to the stat of the original.✗/</p> <pre><code>{
