ID<code>argon:cooldown_control</code> While enabled, makes the listed key bind abilities recharge faster. It can also take time off the longest remaining cooldown whenever the user kills a qualifying entity. SettingsExampleIn a power <p>KeyTypeDescriptionRequiredFallback<code>abilities</code>Ability Reference[]The key bind abilities whose cooldowns are affected.✓/<code>recharge_multiplier</code>(Dynamic) ValueHow fast cooldowns count down while enabled. 1 is normal, 1.5 is half again as fast.✗1<code>on_kill</code>Cooldown KillOn a kill, takes reduce ticks off the longest remaining cooldown among the listed abilities. The victim must be hostile (unless hostile_only is false) and, if any of entity_tag, beneficial_effect (it has a beneficial effect) or power (it owns a matching power) is given, match at least one of them.✗/</p> <p><p><code>on_kill</code> (Cooldown Kill)</p></p> <p>KeyTypeDescriptionRequiredFallback<code>reduce</code>Integer,Time String ("40s", "2m", etc.)How much cooldown a kill removes.✓/<code>hostile_only</code>BooleanOnly hostile mobs count.✗/<code>entity_tag</code>Entity Type TagOnly entities in this tag count.✗/<code>beneficial_effect</code>BooleanOnly entities with a beneficial effect count.✗/<code>power</code>Power RequirementOnly entities that match this power requirement count.✗/</p> <p><p><code>on_kill.power</code> (Power Requirement)</p></p> <p>KeyTypeDescriptionRequiredFallback<code>power</code>Power ID(s) / TagThe power or powers the entity has to have.✓/<code>mode</code><code>include</code><code>exclude</code>Whether the entity must have the power (include) or must not have it (exclude).✗include</p> <pre><code>{
  "type": "argon:cooldown_control",
  "abilities": [],
  "recharge_multiplier": 1.4
}
</code></pre> <pre><code>{
