ID<code>argon:dispel</code> On its first enabled tick, picks the ally or enemy the user looks at within range and removes effects from it, optionally healing it. With ally_or_self, the user is cleansed when no ally is targeted. SettingsExampleIn a power <p>KeyTypeDescriptionRequiredFallback<code>target</code><code>ally</code><code>enemy</code><code>ally_or_self</code>Who can be targeted: "ally" (teammates, pets), "enemy", or "ally_or_self".✗ally<code>range</code>DoubleHow far away the target can be, in blocks.✗3.0<code>dispel</code>DispelWhich effects are removed: category is "beneficial" or "harmful", count is how many (longest first), skip_bosses protects bosses.✓/<code>heal</code>(Dynamic) ValueHealth restored to the target.✗/</p> <p><p><code>dispel</code> (Dispel)</p></p> <p>KeyTypeDescriptionRequiredFallback<code>category</code><code>beneficial</code><code>harmful</code>Which category of effects is removed.✗/<code>count</code>Integer (1 ~ 64)How many effects are removed at most.✗/<code>skip_bosses</code>BooleanIf true, boss mobs are not dispelled.✗/</p> <pre><code>{
