ID<code>argon:dome</code> When enabled, creates a dome of air around the user. While it lasts, the user, their team and pets inside take less physical damage and projectiles from anyone else bounce off. Hostile mobs inside are pushed out. SettingsExampleIn a power <p>KeyTypeDescriptionRequiredFallback<code>radius</code>(Dynamic) ValueThe radius of the dome in blocks, read once when it is created, so it can scale with power age.✗6<code>duration</code>Integer,Time String ("40s", "2m", etc.)How long the dome lasts.✗200<code>damage_reduction</code>FloatThe fraction from 0 to 1 of melee and projectile damage removed for those protected inside.✗0.4<code>deflect_projectiles</code>BooleanWhether projectiles that are not from the user's allies bounce off the dome.✗true<code>protect_all_players</code>BooleanWhether every player inside is protected instead of only the user's team.✗false<code>repel</code>FloatHow hard hostile mobs inside the dome are pushed out each tick. 0 disables it.✗0.25<code>color</code>ColorThe colour of the dome.✗#cfeeff<code>follow_user</code>BooleanIf true, the dome moves with the user while it lasts instead of staying where it was cast. It ends early if the user is gone.✗false<code>end_with_ability</code>BooleanIf true, the dome ends as soon as this ability is no longer enabled.✗false<code>quiet</code>BooleanIf true, the dome makes no sound and spawns no gust or poof particles, so it is only the shell. Combine with damage_reduction 0, deflect_projectiles false and repel 0 for a purely visual dome.✗false</p> <pre><code>{
