ID<code>argon:energy_modifier</code> While enabled, changes the stored energy on the item in the given slot every "rate" ticks. Never goes below 0 and has no effect on infinite or creative energy items. SettingsExample 1Example 2Example 3In a power <p>KeyTypeDescriptionRequiredFallback<code>slot</code><code>mainhand</code><code>offhand</code><code>head</code><code>chest</code><code>legs</code><code>feet</code><code>body</code><code>curios:head</code><code>curios:necklace</code>Which slot to modify the energy-storing item in.✗curios:hands<code>operation</code><code>add</code><code>subtract</code><code>set</code>Whether "value" is added to the item's energy, subtracted from it, or set as its new energy outright.✗SUBTRACT<code>value</code>(Dynamic) ValueThe amount used by "operation", evaluated fresh every time the ability modifies the item.✓/<code>rate</code>Integer,Time String ("40s", "2m", etc.)How long to wait between modifications.✗20</p> <pre><code>{
