ID<code>argon:flight_speed_adjuster</code> A saved flight speed dial from "min_value" to "max_value" (starting at "default_value"), changed by a dependent mod's adjust(entity, steps). Read it with argon:flight_speed or argon:flight_speed_percent. SettingsExampleIn a power <p>KeyTypeDescriptionRequiredFallback<code>division_amount</code>Doublecurrent_value is divided by this to get the speed added to the flight type's base speed.✗100.0<code>min_value</code>IntegerThe lowest the dial can be adjusted to.✗1<code>max_value</code>IntegerThe highest the dial can be adjusted to.✗100<code>default_value</code>IntegerThe dial's starting value when this ability is first granted.✗1</p> <pre><code>{
  "type": "argon:flight_speed_adjuster",
