}
</code></pre>

ID<code>argon:fluid_modifier</code> While enabled, changes the stored fluid amount on the fluid item in the given slot every "rate" ticks, kept between 0 and the item's capacity. SettingsExample 1Example 2Example 3In a power <p>KeyTypeDescriptionRequiredFallback<code>slot</code><code>mainhand</code><code>offhand</code><code>head</code><code>chest</code><code>legs</code><code>feet</code><code>body</code><code>curios:head</code><code>curios:necklace</code>Which slot to modify the fluid-storing item in.✗curios:hands<code>operation</code><code>add</code><code>subtract</code><code>set</code>Whether "value" is added to the item's stored fluid amount, subtracted from it, or set as its new amount outright.✗SUBTRACT<code>value</code>(Dynamic) ValueThe amount used by "operation", evaluated fresh every time the ability modifies the item.✓/<code>rate</code>Integer,Time String ("40s", "2m", etc.)How long to wait between modifications.✗20</p> <pre><code>{
