  "icon": "minecraft:command_block",
  "abilities": {
    "fluid_modifier": {
      "type": "argon:fluid_modifier",
      "value": 50
    }
  }
}
</code></pre>

ID<code>argon:fluid_transfer</code> While enabled, moves "value" of the given fluid every "rate" ticks from the fluid item in "from_slot" to the one in "to_slot". Limited by the source's fluid and the destination's room. SettingsExampleIn a power <p>KeyTypeDescriptionRequiredFallback<code>from_slot</code><code>mainhand</code><code>offhand</code><code>head</code><code>chest</code><code>legs</code><code>feet</code><code>body</code><code>curios:head</code><code>curios:necklace</code>Which slot to take the fluid-storing item to draw from.✓/<code>to_slot</code><code>mainhand</code><code>offhand</code><code>head</code><code>chest</code><code>legs</code><code>feet</code><code>body</code><code>curios:head</code><code>curios:necklace</code>Which slot to take the fluid-storing item to fill.✓/<code>fluid</code>Fluid IDThe fluid that must be stored on both the "from_slot" and "to_slot" items for the transfer to happen.✓/<code>value</code>(Dynamic) ValueThe amount to move per transfer, evaluated fresh every time the ability transfers fluid.✓/<code>rate</code>Integer,Time String ("40s", "2m", etc.)How long to wait between transfers.✗20</p> <pre><code>{
  "type": "argon:fluid_transfer",
  "from_slot": "curios:hands",
  "to_slot": "curios:back",
  "fluid": "minecraft:water",
  "value": 50
}
</code></pre> <pre><code>{
