ID<code>argon:item_storage</code> While enabled, shows a scrollable strip of item slots near the hotbar. Right-click swaps a slot with the main hand. Items are stored on the entity by default, or on a given equipment or Curios slot. SettingsExampleIn a power <p>KeyTypeDescriptionRequiredFallback<code>max_items</code>Integer (&gt; 0)The total number of storable slots.✓/<code>item_filter</code>Identifier[]List of item ids allowed to be stored, or any item if left empty.✗[]<code>slot</code><code>mainhand</code><code>offhand</code><code>head</code><code>chest</code><code>legs</code><code>feet</code><code>body</code><code>curios:head</code><code>curios:necklace</code>If set, items are stored on the item in this equipment or Curios slot instead of on the entity.✗/<code>position</code>Vector 2DPixel offset of the slot strip from its default spot above the hotbar.✗net.minecraft.world.phys.Vec2@631c244c</p> <pre><code>{
