ID<code>argon:possess</code> Lets the user see through, and optionally control the movement of, a possessed living entity until a set exit condition triggers. SettingsExampleIn a power <p>KeyTypeDescriptionRequiredFallback<code>range</code>DoubleHow far away a living entity can be to be possessed in the first place.✓/<code>end_on_damage</code>BooleanIf true, the user's own body taking damage while possessing immediately ends the possession.✗true<code>jumps</code>Integer (&gt;= 0)How many times the user can jump straight from one possessed target to another, or never if 0.✗0<code>distance_from_body</code>DoubleIf set, possession ends once the target strays this many blocks from the user's stationary body.✗/<code>control_target_movement</code>BooleanIf true, the user's movement input controls the target instead of being locked. For players it is gated by the possessMovementOverrideCanAffectPlayers config option.✗false</p> <pre><code>{
