d results in the radar.✗[]</p> <p><p><code>rotation</code> (Radar Rotation)</p></p> <p>KeyTypeDescriptionRequiredFallback<code>mode</code><code>look_direction</code><code>static</code>Whether the radar turns with the user's view or stays fixed.✗/<code>static_angle</code>(Dynamic) ValueThe fixed angle in degrees when the mode is static.✗/</p> <p><p><code>border</code> (Radar Border)</p></p> <p>KeyTypeDescriptionRequiredFallback<code>color</code>ColorThe color of the border.✗/<code>thickness</code>IntegerThe thickness of the border in pixels.✗/</p> <p><p><code>attachment_overrides[]</code> (Radar Override)</p></p> <p>KeyTypeDescriptionRequiredFallback<code>data_attachment</code>Data Attachment IDThe data attachment that is checked.✓/<code>value</code>StringThe attachment value that triggers the override.✓/<code>color</code>ColorThe color used for matching entities.✓/<code>range</code>(Dynamic) ValueThe range used for matching entities.✓/</p> <pre><code>{
