ID<code>argon:teleport_to_location</code> On activation, teleports the entity to the position, facing and dimension saved under "namespace" by argon:save_location, searching upward for open space. Does nothing if none is saved. SettingsExampleIn a power <p>KeyTypeDescriptionRequiredFallback<code>namespace</code>StringThe name of the location to teleport to, saved earlier by an argon:save_location ability with the same namespace.✓/<code>reset_ability</code>StringAnother ability, e.g. "fsang:example#driving_ability", to cut short once the teleport happens, so a later step in a shared animation timer sequence doesn't fire after the entity's state changed.✗/</p> <pre><code>{
  "type": "argon:teleport_to_location",
  "namespace": "home"
