ID<code>argon:vortex</code> When enabled, creates a vortex of cutting air where the user looks, on the ground at the end of the aim. While it lasts it pulls living entities inside toward its center and damages them in pulses. SettingsExampleIn a power <p>KeyTypeDescriptionRequiredFallback<code>max_distance</code>(Dynamic) ValueHow far away, in blocks, the vortex can be placed.✗18<code>radius</code>FloatThe radius of the vortex in blocks.✗5.0<code>duration</code>Integer,Time String ("40s", "2m", etc.)How long the vortex lasts.✗100<code>damage_per_second</code>FloatDamage dealt per second to each entity inside. 0 for a vortex that does no damage.✗4.0<code>max_damage</code>FloatThe most damage the vortex deals to one entity in total.✗20.0<code>pull</code>DoubleHow strongly entities are pulled towards the centre each tick.✗0.04<code>pulse_interval</code>Integer,Time String ("40s", "2m", etc.)How often damage is dealt.✗5<code>damage_type</code>Damage Type IDDamage type ID the damage is dealt as. Unset, it is a player attack for players and a mob attack otherwise.✗/<code>track_entities</code>BooleanWhether the vortex forms around the living entity the user looks at within max_distance and follows it, instead of forming on the ground.✗true<code>center_on_user</code>BooleanWhether the vortex forms around the user and follows them instead of where they are aiming.✗false<code>suspend</code>Integer,Time String ("40s", "2m", etc.)For this long after forming, entities small enough hover inside the vortex instead of falling. 0 for none.✗0<code>suspend_max_volume</code>FloatThe largest bounding box volume, in cubic blocks, of an entity that gets suspended. A zombie is about 0.7, an iron golem about 5. Bosses are never suspended.✗2.0<code>funnel_visual</code>BooleanWhether a layered swirling funnel of wind is drawn over the vortex.✗false</p> <pre><code>{
