  }
}
</code></pre>

ID<code>argon:ward</code> On its first enabled tick, gives the user an absorption pool that soaks up all incoming damage until it runs out or the duration ends. Can reduce knockback, cost some health (never below 1) and briefly stop natural regeneration. SettingsExampleIn a power <p>KeyTypeDescriptionRequiredFallback<code>pool</code>(Dynamic) ValueHow much damage the ward absorbs, read once when it starts.✓/<code>duration</code>Integer,Time String ("40s", "2m", etc.)How long the ward lasts.✗120<code>knockback_reduction</code>FloatThe fraction from 0 to 1 of knockback removed while the ward is up.✗0.0<code>self_cost</code>DoubleHealth the user pays to cast it. It never takes them below half a heart.✗0.0<code>regen_lock</code>Integer,Time String ("40s", "2m", etc.)If above 0, stops healing for this long after casting.✗0</p> <pre><code>{
