ID<code>argon:zone</code> On its first enabled tick, makes a circle on the ground at the user or where they look. Every interval it damages enemies inside and applies effects to them and allies, and allies take less damage. Ends when time is up or the user strays too far. SettingsExampleIn a power <p>KeyTypeDescriptionRequiredFallback<code>radius</code>(Dynamic) ValueThe radius of the circle in blocks, read once when it is created.✓/<code>duration</code>Integer,Time String ("40s", "2m", etc.)How long the zone lasts.✗100<code>look_target_range</code>DoubleIf set, the zone is created where the user looks, up to this many blocks away, instead of at the user.✗/<code>interval</code>Integer,Time String ("40s", "2m", etc.)How often damage and effects are applied.✗20<code>damage</code>(Dynamic) ValueDamage dealt to each enemy on every interval.✗0<code>damage_type</code>Damage Type IDThe damage type used; the user's normal attack when left out.✗/<code>effects</code>Beam Effect[]Effects applied to enemies on every interval.✗/<code>ally_effects</code>Beam Effect[]Effects applied to the user, their team and their pets on every interval.✗/<code>ally_damage_reduction</code>(Dynamic) ValueThe fraction from 0 to 1 of damage the user, their team and their pets do not take while inside. A Value read once when the zone is created, so it can scale with power age.✗0.0<code>follow_user</code>BooleanIf true, the zone moves with the user instead of staying where it was created.✗false<code>reduction_affects_user</code>BooleanIf false, the damage reduction applies only to allies, not the user (useful when the user has their own reduction).✗true<code>end_with_ability</code>BooleanIf true, the zone ends as soon as this ability is no longer enabled.✗false<code>end_beyond</code>DoubleIf set, the zone ends when the user is farther than this many blocks from its centre.✗/<code>particle</code>ParticleA particle drawn around the edge of the zone.✗/</p> <p><p><code>effects[]</code> (Beam Effect)</p></p> <p>KeyTypeDescriptionRequiredFallback<code>effect</code>Mob Effect IDThe effect to apply.✓/<code>duration</code>Integer,Time String ("40s", "2m", etc.)How long the effect lasts.✗/<code>amplifier</code>Integer (0 ~ 255)The effect level, starting at 0.✗/<code>particles</code>BooleanWhether the effect shows its particles.✗/<code>size_tiers</code>Size Tier[]Changes or skips the effect depending on the width or type of the target.✗/</p> <p><p><code>effects[].size_tiers[]</code> (Size Tier)</p></p> <p>KeyTypeDescriptionRequiredFallback<code>tag</code>Entity Type TagOnly entities in this tag use the tier.✗/<code>min_width</code>Double (0.0 ~ 64.0)The tier applies to entities at least this wide, in blocks.✗0.0<code>skip</code>BooleanIf true, matching entities do not get the effect at all.✗false<code>effect</code>Mob Effect IDReplaces the effect for matching entities.✗/<code>amplifier</code>Integer (0 ~ 255)Replaces the amplifier for matching entities.✗/<code>duration</code>Integer,Time String ("40s", "2m", etc.)Replaces the duration for matching entities.✗/</p> <pre><code>{
  "type": "argon:zone",
  "radius": 5,
  "damage": 2,
  "ally_damage_reduction": 0
}
</code></pre> <pre><code>{
